@startgantt 07_gantt
title Planificación temporal de AutoCuida por etapas (4 h por día laborable; entrega: 06/12/2026)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
language es
hide footbox
printscale daily zoom 1.2
saturday are closed
sunday are closed
Project starts 2026-11-12

-- Etapa 1 · Inicio del proyecto --
[Análisis de requisitos y estudio de mercado] as [A1] lasts 2 days

-- Etapa 2 · Diseño de la solución --
[Arquitectura, base de datos y navegación] as [D1] lasts 1 day
[D1] starts at [A1]'s end
[Sistema de diseño, mockups y diagramas] as [D2] lasts 2 days
[D2] starts at [D1]'s end

-- Etapa 3 · Fase de desarrollo --
[Capa de datos y lógica de dominio] as [I1] lasts 2 days
[I1] starts at [D2]'s end
[Pantallas y navegación] as [I2] lasts 2 days
[I2] starts at [I1]'s end
[Notificaciones y gastos] as [I3] lasts 1 day
[I3] starts at [I2]'s end
[Pruebas y compatibilidad] as [I4] lasts 2 days
[I4] starts at [I3]'s end

-- Etapa 4 · Fase final --
[Trabajo escrito, manuales y diagramas definitivos] as [F1] lasts 3 days
[F1] starts at [I4]'s end
[Presentación y vídeo] as [F2] lasts 1 day
[F2] starts at [F1]'s end
[Revisión final, versión firmada y entrega] as [F3] lasts 1 day
[F3] starts at [F2]'s end
@endgantt
